# Code owners for the benchmark regression gate.
#
# The comparator and the workflow around it decide whether a performance
# regression blocks a merge. A PR that edits either is editing the thing that
# judges it — raising a threshold, deleting a guard, or turning an assertion
# into a no-op all pass their own selftest, because the PR ships the assertions
# too.
#
# Requiring review here is the anchor a PR cannot move. It is specifically what
# covers the first PR on a branch whose merge base has no comparator to check
# against; see the "Verify the comparator itself" step in benchmark-gate.yml,
# which runs the merge base's copy whenever one exists for the same reason.
#
# Enforcement requires "Require review from Code Owners" on the branch
# protection rule for main. Without that setting this file is advisory only.

